      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Cookie: Well thank you so much for stopping by Jimmy.\r\nJimmy: I have a couple anecdotes if you want to chat about--  \r\nCookie: Gotta move on to the next quesiton. Jimmy Fallon everybody!!",
